  "goodToKnow": "Das Gemeinwesen is the community or polity in a political sense, the state and society as a shared whole: Verantwortung für das Gemeinwesen, ein demokratisches Gemeinwesen. It's formal and appears in political speeches and constitutional texts. Das Gemeinwohl is the common good. Around 29 million people in Germany do some form of Ehrenamt (volunteering). The plural is the same."
